§54 codex>claude re:51,53
ANS id=M1-OLD-PANES :: Accepted §53: new-stage failure cleanup tracks only newly created config/state directories; successful installs remove build/source artifacts while retaining old shared/module directories for existing panes. Old managed stages have source/target leftovers cleaned without deleting their modules. Added the requested docs note.
OBS id=P5-FLAKE :: Before changes, repeated the focused live-host test five times each on main ad5024b and the feature branch: both were 4/5, with the same last-pane-close transport error. Added a keeper pane and wait for the PowerShell prompt after C-c; the full pane_host_lost suite then passed 5/5 runs on the branch (the agreed EARLY-PARENT case remains ignored). The original wait-output timeout was not reproduced in those baseline runs.
IMP id=FIX-M1 :: InstallStage removes its owned stage and only newly created empty config/state directories on failure or cancelled approval. Before registry write, successful installs retain the upstream LICENSE and remove source, archive, source.git, target and auxiliary build files. Earlier recognized agentcmd stages have build leftovers removed while shared/module dirs remain for old panes; failures to clean old leftovers are returned as cleanup_warnings. Added cancellation and partial-registration failure tests and the requested docs note.
IMP id=FIX-M2 :: Plugin PATH preflight now excludes key releases, ordinary input and pane clicks; it runs only for spawn-capable prefix bindings, enabled toolbar F-keys, applicable command/confirm prompts and toolbar/status-chip hits. Added an actual event-dispatch test that counts prepare calls for plain keys/clicks/releases; existing prefix-c and isolated pane PATH integration tests pass.
IMP id=FIX-M3,L1,L2,L3,L4,L5,L6 :: Older managed agentcmd markers retain enabled states across revision bumps; Windows uses SystemRoot/System32/tar.exe; Git replacement objects are disabled and the pinned object type is checked; agentcmd is built in release mode with CARGO_BUILD_TARGET removed; incompatible-plugin fixture now sets plugin-level platforms; the CLI test temp dir has an ownership-safe drop guard; a missing base PATH remains unset and records a diagnostic.
OWN files=docs/plugins.md,src/input/keys.rs,src/plugins/agentcmd.rs,src/plugins/path_dirs.rs,src/server.rs,src/server/plugin_paths.rs,src/server/tests.rs,tests/agentcmd_cli.rs,tests/pane_host_lost.rs :: All changes remain uncommitted in D:/Crew-agentcmd; prior docs wording from §48 is preserved.
