TST ev=cmd:pane_host_lost_repeat :: After the fixture fix, cargo test --locked --offline --test pane_host_lost was run five times: all 5 exit 0. Before the fix, the focused live-host test was 4/5 on both main and branch with the same last-pane-close transport failure.
